      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-blue max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <div id="comparison" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">NordicTrack C 700 vs C 990</h2>
        <p>
          The C 990 is the C 700's closest rival: the next rung up the C-Series
          ladder, with a touchscreen, a 60-inch deck and a slightly stronger
          motor. Here's how the C 700 stacks up against it and the C 1650 above
          it; our <a href="/nordictrack-c-990-treadmill/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">C 990 review</a>
          has the full detail.
        </p>
        </div>
      </div>

